v0.93
New Content
New Tower – Wizard Tower: Fires homing arcane bolts with high range and medium-fast travel speed, prioritizing enemies that hook towers as a direct counter to hooking units.

Level 1: Fires a single homing arcane bolt at medium range.

Level 2: Increases attack rate and range.

Level 3: Fires 2 homing projectiles.

Level 4A: Grants global range.

Level 4B: Increases to 3 projectiles with faster projectile speed.

Skill Evolution System: Choose a basic skill at the start of a run; every 100 kills earned using that skill evolves it through 4 tiers:

Drop Bomb: Drop Bomb → Cluster Bomb → Heavy Bomb → Mini Nuke.

Wind Blow: Wind Blow → Freezing Wind Blow → Small Tornado → Big Tornado.

Place Mine: Place Mine → Place 3 Mines → Place 3 Incendiary Mines → Place 1 Megamine.

Harpoon Throw: Harpoon Throw → Arrow Barrage → Big Ballista Bolt → Big Exploding Ballista Bolt.

Lightning Bolt from Sky: Lightning Bolt → Bigger Lightning Bolt → Small Storm (3s duration) → Big Storm (3s duration).

