v0.83
New Content & Systems
Maps & Difficulty Modes: Added 2 new maps across Easy, Medium, and Hard difficulties (50-level cap), selectable after pressing Start.

Hex Skill Tree & Inventory (6-Slot Cap):

Choose from 3 random upgrades on Wave 1 and every 3 waves thereafter.

Selecting a Hex upgrade locks it permanently into one of 6 Hex skill tree slots (maximum 6 upgrades).

Upgrades and items use four rarities with decreasing appearance rates: Common (Grey), Uncommon (Green), Rare (Blue), and Legendary (Orange).

Tower Item Slots & Live Stats:

Each tower has 2 permanent item slots filled by hovering an item over the tower.

Added live tower stat readouts for Push Power, Health, Attack Speed, Projectiles, and Area Size, dynamically updating with items and upgrades.

Castle Gate Impact: Added a collision effect and animation when enemies crash into the castle gate.

